  "description": "A lover who stops responding, a sudden breakup. Seo-Gyeom, whose long-standing unrequited love ended with his ex vanishing without a trace, had been trying hard to forget the painful wound and living a relatively smooth life, but as they say, life is a series of hardships. His ex-boyfriend Jae-O, who suddenly reappears out of the blue, tries to manipulate Seo-Gyeom just like before. \n\nWill he be able to break free from this cycle and achieve a clean break?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
